1. Compute the gradient of \(f\):
\[
\nabla f = \left( \frac{\partial f}{\partial x}, \frac{\partial f}{\partial y}, \frac{\partial f}{\partial z} \right) = \left( 2x, 2y, 18z \right)
\]

