For Darcy, the distance is 104,000 cm.
Speed = 90 steps/minute × 55 cm/step = 4950 cm/minute.
Time = Distance / Speed = 104,000 cm / 4950 cm/minute = 104,000 / 4950 = 10400 / 495 = 2080 / 99.

2080 divided by 99 is:
2080 = 99 × 21 + 11
2080 / 99 = 21 + 11/99
