\[
\mathbf{C} = 0 \cdot \mathbf{i} + 0 \cdot \mathbf{j} + \left( \frac{\partial Q}{\partial x} - \frac{\partial P}{\partial y} \right) \mathbf{k}.
\]
Thus, the curl is:
\[
\mathbf{C} = \left( \frac{\partial Q}{\partial x} - \frac{\partial P}{\partial y} \right) \mathbf{k}.
\]

